%% HAND-CURATED. Race-condition surfacing per plan §11: ETag/If-Match version field on PUT.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant ControlsService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant ConfigService

    ParentApp->>Gateway: PUT /v1/controls/:deviceId {settings, expected_version}
    Gateway->>Gateway: JWT validate and household membership and rate-limit 10/hr/device
    Gateway->>ControlsService: forward request

    alt unauthorized
        ControlsService-->>Gateway: 401 UNAUTHORIZED
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401
    else insufficient_role
        ControlsService-->>Gateway: 403 INSUFFICIENT_ROLE (viewer attempted write)
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
    else device_not_found
        ControlsService-->>Gateway: 404 DEVICE_NOT_FOUND
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 404
    else invalid_payload
        Note over ControlsService: invalid_daily_limit · invalid_per_session_limit · invalid_quiet_hours
        ControlsService-->>Gateway: 422 {code}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 422
    else success
        ControlsService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE parent_controls SET ..., version=version+1 WHERE device_id=$1 AND version=$expected
        alt version_conflict (0 rows affected)
            PostgreSQL-->>ControlsService: 0 rows
            ControlsService-->>Gateway: 409 VERSION_CONFLICT
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409 {currentVersion}
            ParentApp->>Gateway: GET /v1/controls/:deviceId
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 {current settings, version}
        else updated
            PostgreSQL-->>ControlsService: 1 row
            ControlsService->>ConfigService: rebuildConfig(deviceId) (async)
            alt config_service_failure
                ConfigService-->>ControlsService: error
                ControlsService-->>Gateway: 200 {configPropagationStatus: "pending"}
            else config_rebuilt
                ConfigService-->>ControlsService: ok
                ControlsService-->>Gateway: 200 {configPropagationStatus: "pushed"}
            end
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 {updated controls, configPropagationStatus}
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp,ConfigService: optimistic concurrency via version field — last-write-wins with 409 on stale version — async config rebuild reconciled every 5 minutes
